Z||000002||Pontiaddict||09-08-2000||08:34 PM||||The ring and pinion is part of the transaxle. That's how the transaxle got it's name, it's a combination of the two.<BR>I think you can use your original tranny mounts if you get the 4spd. You might be able to swap in the 5 speed if you get all of the parts off the 5spd car. Not sure though.||||reg||1
